      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached four bedroom bungalow.\r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation.\r\nGenerous surrounding gardens.\r\nLocated approximately 2km from Ballinrobe town centre.\r\nExtending to approximately 141 sq. m (1,518 sq. ft).\r\nOn a site area extending to approximately 0.19 hectares (0.46 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached four bedroom bungalow with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 141 sq. m (1,518 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
